feat(agent): add bounded native3 authority lifetimes

Replace lifetime context identity history with monitored authority leases and
fenced context tickets. Preserve physical credits through authority loss, and
keep the application-owned listening endpoint alive across native child failures.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Co-authored-by: Billo AI <ai-engineering@billo.systems>

